 "notes": "Answers: addresses are 'street, city, ST ZIP' and split into the form's boxes. The EIN's printed boxes are checkboxes on this PDF, so the EIN is printed into them, two digits then seven. officer1 and officer2 are 'full name, title, % of ownership': the name splits into last, first and middle and the title ticks its box (Member, President, Partner...). owner_business is 'name, % of ownership'. inspection_language 'English' answers No to question 6; any other language answers Yes and ticks it ('Other: language' writes it). 'None' leaves an optional line blank. Section 2 (individual general partners' SSN or ITIN, home address and child support certification) is never filled by Placetta; the sales tax number boxes (a broken radio group on this PDF), the section 4 disclosure questions, the preparer's statement, the signature, the date and the voter registration question are left for the applicant.",
